  "contract_traces": [
    "direct::connect_tcp_keeping_slower: both ordinary resolver/dial operations produce one io Result; final map is DirectConnectError::Connect. Profiled/source-bound tcp::connect_keeping_slower propagates resolver io failures into this same map.",
    "direct::connect_tcp_with_lookup maps resolve_noting_cache errors to DirectConnectError::Connect before HTTPS-record extra-time selection.",
    "connection_leg Direct branch and H1/H2/negotiated conversion preserve Connect; facade RequestError::http1/http2/http1_or_2 maps it to RequestErrorKind::Connect.",
    "HTTP3 direct resolver maps through Http3ConnectorError::resolve, kind Resolve, then RequestError::http3 maps Resolve unchanged.",
    "Local SOCKS5 target resolver maps through Socks5Error::resolve; shared facade mapping preserves Resolve rather than Proxy or direct Connect.",
    "Connection-setup retry markers are set separately from public category. This documentation commit changes neither mapping nor retry behavior."
